From 8d736876a074f6c600cb24de34339d4f3bd08266 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:40:47 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 104/230] Trim Matchday UI to the core five: timeline, predict,
 stats, lineups
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Remove the Ratings, Leaderboards, and Predictions screens and their tabs
from MatchDetail, the TabBar, and Profile. The MatchDetail Stats tab gets
a Home/Away segmented control and drops PitchView/GoalGrid; the Timeline
tab drops the live discussion/comments panels. Landscape CSS already in
index.css covers the ad slot, boot, and tab bar heights. The offline
toast hook does not exist in this codebase — React Query error + retry
is the only offline path. Fix the seedTeams.ts file encoding (literal
\n → real newlines) and widen the ESPN types so cups/internationals
slug arrays accept non-big-five strings.

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
